note Deliberately wrong compiled control: saturating addition violates modulo-u64 behavior at max+1.
note Expected oracle result for max+1 is 0; this program returns the faulty candidate result and must exit nonzero.
note Provenance: L776 / action L776-653-public-oracle-01 / source head cd5897e3f92f72a015892c67b17f096e433b54f7.

fn umax to ulong
ret 18446744073709551615
end

fn saturating_add a ulong b ulong to ulong
sum = add a b
if lt sum a
ret umax
end
ret sum
end

fn main to int
ret int saturating_add umax 1
end
